  {
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "text": "## Storing Numbers in the Memory"
  },
  {
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "text": "We can also store numbers in the calculator using the STO button."
  },
  {
   "kind": "figure",
   "figure_ref": "assets/030-Calculator-buttons-STO.jpg",
   "alt": "Calculator buttons STO"
  },
  {
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "text": "When we have an answer we can press STO and then one of the keys with a pink letter above. We have the letters A, B, C, D, E, F, X, Y and M."
  },
  {
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "text": "We can type 2 × 5 into the calculator and press equals to get an answer of 10"
